          "short": "$168^\\circ$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\angle BOC&=180^\\circ-62^\\circ=118^\\circ\\\\\\angle BOD&=\\angle BOC+\\angle COD\\\\&=118^\\circ+50^\\circ\\\\&=168^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
